WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:07.980
<i>Shouken.</i>

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.990
<i>Just listen to what I have to say. 
You don't need to respond.</i>

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:17.000
<i>Two months ago, 3,876 people committed 
suicide by mass immolation.</i>

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.490
<i>The leader was executed on the spot for 
large-scale preaching of a religion.</i>

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:25.620
<i>One month ago, a lone extremist 
burned 21 shamans to death.</i>

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:30.760
<i>A psychic's ability to mislead 
people is spread by their voice.</i>

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:33.460
<i>A person with the ultimate 
psychic powers like Tanmoku Ki</i>

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:36.130
<i>could easily make people lose all reason.</i>

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.260
<i>Don't forget.</i>

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:42.890
<i>You absolutely cannot let Tanmoku Ki 
participate in any vocal events.</i>

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:58.580
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:20.610
Episode 10
Secret Feelings

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:45.140
<i>The observer cannot have any personal 
feelings for the Youmeishi.</i>

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:49.390
<i>Don't make the same mistake again.</i>

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:53.830
<i>I haven't forgotten.</i>

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.400
<i>While I am Tanmoku Ki's bodyguard,</i>

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.910
<i>the words my brother said 
the day I left home</i>

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:05.180
<i>with my absolutely secret mission 
still ring in my ears.</i>

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.750
Protect Tanmoku Ki with all your might.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:14.540
When something happens to him, your blood 
is the only thing that can save him.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.690
But do not forget.

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.470
Your true status is that of the observer.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.230
Always monitor Tanmoku Ki.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:27.350
If he makes any disturbing movements 
or does anything that deceives God,

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.350
kill him instantly.

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:37.030
<i>The Shinryuu family, a noble family 
well-versed in herbal medicine,</i>

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:39.720
<i>appears to be subordinate 
to the Tanmoku family,</i>

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:44.700
<i>but in fact, they have been entrusted 
with secretly monitoring the Youmeishi.</i>

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.830
<i>For ages, the position of the 
observer has been kept secret</i>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.700
<i>and they have served the Youmeishi.</i>

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:55.310
<i>They have assisted and guided 
generations of Youmeishi.</i>

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:02.390
<i>The power of the Youmeishi is 
great and respected by everyone.</i>

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:07.530
<i>They must not remove people from 
their path or disturb the ceremonies.</i>

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.480
<i>Until now,</i>

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:17.350
<i>there have been many Youmeishi who have 
accepted the sanctions of the observers.</i>

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:22.610
<i>The Youmeishi's life is short, so even 
though they suddenly lose their lives,</i>

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.650
<i>the possibility of people 
becoming suspicious is low.</i>

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:29.060
<i>Their lives are taken from them at the 
moment they shine the brightest.</i>

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.580
<i>It is the duty of the 
Shinryuu family to make sure</i>

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.960
<i>they don't leave behind any blemishes.</i>

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.250
<i>The reason the Tanmoku family has 
held firmly to it's position is</i>

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.460
<i>due to the assassinations by the observers.</i>

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:44.930
<i>Unbeknownst to others, we buried their 
sins and mistakes in the darkness.</i>

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.970
<i>Leaving behind glory for the Tanmoku 
family and hope for the world.</i>

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:53.950
That was his actual position?

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.770
Tanmoku Ki...

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.660
Observer.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.280
If his duty was to monitor me, then 
why did he do something like that?!

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:04.070
Why?

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.990
Tanmoku Ki.

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:11.330
Keika, what's wrong?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.430
I don't know. I just suddenly felt...

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.460
Happy birthday.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:22.460
<i>I didn't want to increase 
the pressure on him.</i>

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:24.970
It's beautiful.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:30.470
<i>He had lost both of his parents as a child 
and was shown no kindness by his relatives.</i>

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.470
Your hair is woven into it.

00:05:34.650 --> 00:05:36.420
The hair I gave you?

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.940
This is my thanks for that.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:09.310
<i>Master, I would want to always 
stay by your side if I could.</i>

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:15.810
<i>But there is no word more 
fleeting than that of "forever."</i>

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:17.480
Forever?

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:21.480
Yes. What do you think 
"forever" means, my lady?

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:26.970
Wait a moment.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.450
Forever is like amber.

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.170
Time is sealed within it.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.290
Almost like a contract.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.790
<i>Like a contract that seals time.</i>

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:48.170
Such as a marriage, for example.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:52.540
The couple exchanges their vows 
to be together forever, right?

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:58.480
I don't really have any interest 
in such things, but if you did...

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.030
<i>I was too focused on my own thoughts.</i>

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:05.940
<i>I didn't notice the feelings 
of a girl in love.</i>

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:09.860
<i>Perhaps it was this moment when we 
were no longer able to turn around.</i>

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.330
<i>The lifespan of a Youmeishi 
is less than twenty years.</i>

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:16.490
<i>When that day comes, I won't 
be able to see him anymore.</i>

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:22.230
<i>So I felt as though I wanted 
some part of him to remain.</i>

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:32.630
<i>If what I'm thinking is right, 
the "forever" that he's hoping for is...</i>

00:07:35.690 --> 00:07:39.140
Master, have you finished your letter?

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.270
I know where he works, so I'll be on my way.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:48.660
Give him this.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:54.110
All right. The location is a bit far, 
so I will be late getting back.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.740
Be careful. Let's have dinner together.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.070
I will. I'll be going now.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:04.120
<i>I must not have personal 
feelings for the Youmeishi,</i>

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:10.100
<i>but I didn't account for the master 
being the object of my mission.</i>

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.430
Dear Sir

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:24.930
Brother?

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:34.530
Th-That's Shinryuu Sekijin.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.990
Keika, what's wrong?

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:44.830
Keika!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.330
Have you sunk so low that 
you're running errands?

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:56.700
This You Keika person seems to be important,
so he couldn't trust anyone else.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:01.060
Where's the internment camp?
Have you removed it?

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:04.940
Master said they were disobeying humanity.

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.940
Shouken, answer me honestly.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:14.150
Is it the world that's in your 
heart, or is it Tanmoku Ki?

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:21.660
His life is short. I want 
him to live it freely.

00:09:22.430 --> 00:09:24.770
Lift your head and look at me.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.380
You stupid fool!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.670
A Youmeishi lives less than twenty years.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:36.170
While they live, they carry out the ceremony and 
when the time comes, they simply die quietly.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.670
You have gotten distracted 
and neglected your duty.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.810
What will you do if this 
affects the ceremony?

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:48.310
What do you think will happen if he wishes 
to live and hesitates to do the ceremony?

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.810
You don't understand him, brother!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.280
M-Master isn't the kind of 
person you think he is.

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:00.280
You...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:09.290
Every single move the Youmeishi makes is 
tied to the very existence of this world.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.290
You are the observer and an outsider!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.300
You cannot have personal feelings!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:19.150
Even a close friend is insignificant 
compared to the peace of the world!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.930
I'm sure you are right, but not...

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.430
to me.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:41.070
Take a good look at that.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.080
You are the shame of the Shinryuu family.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:50.010
If you can't do it, take your own life.

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:05.150
Do you have some business with You Keika?
 Do you have a delivery?

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.470
Ah, no, I have something I want to give him.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:08.780
To me?

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.860
It's not a bill, right?

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:17.860
<i>I should contact master.</i>

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.730
Hello, master?

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:23.820
Yes, yes.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:28.330
A friend? He wants to meet up 
on September 10th?

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:30.530
Why that day?

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.330
Master, master!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:43.380
<i>Keika, if we had been reunited then, 
I'm sure you would have realized.</i>

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.860
<i>The promise I made with master...</i>

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:59.360
But if I used your blood,
it would be unpleasant for me.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:02.430
Please do not worry.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:06.320
As long as I am around, 
that will never happen.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.100
<i>I couldn't protect him.</i>

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.660
Hey, stop him!

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:26.140
You're not going to save him!

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.390
Master!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:35.810
I may not be a good person,

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.390
but I am the only one who can treat the poison.

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.610
Can you kill me? Huh?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:47.270
<i>This man was worthless, but 
he was a threat to the master.</i>

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:51.380
<i>And he knew my secret.</i>

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.790
<i>I couldn't let him live.</i>

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:01.530
<i>Master, even though
I promised to protect you,</i>

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:05.470
<i>I couldn't keep that promise.</i>

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:36.270
<i>I am trained by the Shinryuu family 
with a body resistant to poison.</i>

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:38.960
<i>That also makes my blood an antidote.</i>

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.980
<i>With the acting head knowing my true identity,</i>

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.350
<i>it was only a matter of time 
before others found out.</i>

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:59.540
<i>Once my brother learned I had been dismissed,
 I couldn't stay here much longer.</i>

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:04.140
<i>I had been looking forward to 
my identity being revealed.</i>

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:08.740
<i>Then I thought it would be easier 
for me to be around the master.</i>

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.950
<i>That day, I sent my last secret message.</i>

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:17.890
<i>Protecting Tanmoku Ki and the 
world aren't mutually exclusive.</i>

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:22.170
<i>I wanted my brother to understand that, too.</i>

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:28.590
<i>He is gentle and kind 
and not afraid of death.</i>

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:35.770
<i>This young man's life is 
beautifully fleeting, like a flower.</i>

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.480
<i>That's why I wanted to give him...</i>

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:40.390
<i>forever.</i>

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.980
Shinryuu Shouken!

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:46.860
What have you done?!

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.110
I protected my master.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:54.990
Mistress, please severely punish him
 for doing this to my father.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:59.000
Ran-sama and even everyone in the 
family knows about the ceremony.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:08.010
<i>That's when I knew it was all a trap.</i>

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.470
What will we do if my father 
ends up killing Tanmoku Ki?

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.140
It doesn't matter. I don't care.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.480
What if Shinryuu Shouken finds him?

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.650
It'll be most convenient.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:24.180
We will cast him out from 
the Tanmoku household.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:33.950
<i>Then I realized... I had become 
a hindrance to my master.</i>

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.440
What have the members of 
the Shinryuu family said?

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.960
They want to deal with you themselves.

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:43.270
They're disappointed by your betrayal.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:46.510
<i>I certainly am a traitor.</i>

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:50.380
<i>I betrayed the Shinryuu family, 
and I betrayed my master.</i>

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.970
I'm sure you had your reasons.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.470
Did someone from the Tanmoku 
family threaten you?

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.700
No one is threatening me. It is my will.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.710
<i>I'm sorry. I'm a cowardly person.</i>

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:11.210
<i>You don't need me anymore, 
now that you've grown up.</i>

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:14.030
<i>But I've been trying to monopolize you.</i>

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:17.940
<i>While I kept saying that I would 
protect you, I was the one clinging...</i>

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.330
Let's leave here together.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.950
<i>...to you.</i>

00:16:24.260 --> 00:16:25.820
Master, where are we going?

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:28.750
It doesn't matter. We're leaving here.

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:31.540
You're the Youmeishi. 
What about the ceremony?

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.840
It's fine. They have Jimei-san and Jiun.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.490
I'm going to get you out of here.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:41.690
When the sun rises, we can go to that 
guy's place. I'm sure he'll help us.

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:45.940
<i>I would've gone anywhere with master.</i>

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:48.550
Shouken, is there anywhere you want to go?

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:51.990
<i>Master, you are the Youmeishi.</i>

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:56.150
<i>They will surely find us, 
no matter where we go.</i>

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.450
Shouken?

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.880
I...

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:03.980
Hold it.

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:06.460
<b>Future</b>

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.590
We won't let you get away, Shinryuu Shouken.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.220
You can't get away now.

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.270
Master.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:20.310
You mustn't.

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:25.590
Look. This is irrefutable evidence that 
he has been leaking secrets about you

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:27.810
and the Tanmoku family for years.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:35.330
Iku-san.

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:37.950
<i>Shouken, is true that the 
Youmeishi has run away?</i>

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.270
He's been receiving orders from the outside.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:43.570
It means you were being 
manipulated by him, too.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:44.910
Think about it.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.460
What has he been doing 
since you became the head?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:52.590
<i>Sekijin-san is furious and 
has gone to kill you both.</i>

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:55.260
<i>There's only one path left for you.</i>

00:17:55.700 --> 00:18:00.220
He knows my birthday! He could've 
killed me at any time if he wanted to.

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:03.850
<i>Kill the Youmeishi, quickly.</i>

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:11.530
What's your name?

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:15.240
It was the first time someone cared about me.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.420
I'm glad to have you by my side, Shouken.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.590
Shouken!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.750
Shouken.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:25.660
There has to be some kind of mistake!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:30.170
Shouken wouldn't betray me. 
I guarantee it as his master!

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:33.170
<i>If you kill Tanmoku Ki, you'll be rewarded.</i>

00:18:33.780 --> 00:18:37.140
<i>The members of the Shinryuu 
family will accept you as well.</i>

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.410
Yes, I understand.

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:46.090
There's no way—

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.770
Shouken...

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:56.230
<i>My brother never understood me.</i>

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:08.020
<i>He is the only person I would give my 
life for and the one I want to protect.</i>

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:12.550
Master, do you remember?

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.340
You must not trust people so easily.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:17.690
Even if you have the 
mirror of the underworld,

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.010
you cannot see through people's hearts.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.850
Stop!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:27.350
<i>Goodbye.</i>

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.820
<i>Now I will be free.</i>

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:34.330
<i>I was only his.</i>

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.360
<i>And I was able to give him forever.</i>

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.360
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:13.300
<i>So Shinryuu Shouken didn't 
betray Tanmoku Ki after all.</i>

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:16.870
<i>What a heartbreaking reality.</i>

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:23.030
If I hadn't tried to run, 
if I hadn't tried to hurt anyone,

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:26.010
Shouken wouldn't have had to die.

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:31.000
No. This is surely something 
he decided to do in his heart.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.980
Just like a contract to seal time, 
he made a promise with his soul.

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:38.490
He wanted to be your spirit shadow.

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:42.100
But his soul never came to me.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.510
Was it because of this circle?

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.420
The soul-binding circle.

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:53.480
What the hell?!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:01.740
So this where you were
 hiding my brother.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.650
I finally found him.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.490
Where's Tanmoku-san? I'll go look for him.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.160
Wait.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:13.740
No one from the Tanmoku family 
is here. Something has happened.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.670
We have to try and calm the guests down first.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.890
I'm an outsider, though...

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:20.780
You're the future bride of 
the Tanmoku family, right?

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.170
You'll be fine.

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.680
In Tetsu-sama, we have intruders!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.850
Th-They're from the Shinryuu family!

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:32.140
In Tetsu-sama.

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:35.140
From the Shinryuu family?

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:38.100
I see. So they've finally made their move.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:40.310
Go get your pay from the butler.

00:21:40.310 --> 00:21:41.710
Thank you.

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:45.570
Grandmother.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:50.450
Jimei, I told you before to hold on to this.

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:51.900
Yes.

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:30.550
This spell has made a living corpse.

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:33.340
There is something I have to tell you.

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:36.010
I will clear away your regrets.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Things I Want to Say</b>

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Tanmoku Ki isn't the only 
member of the Tanmoku family.
